summary:
  The REC counter starts at the click instead of when the file exists.

history:
  On 2026-09-23 a recording's file was born 141 s after the click and the
  counter read 11:50 over 592.6 s of audio. On the bench a server that held
  the recorder for 25 s gave REC 0:24 with no file anywhere.

target:
  package/contents/ui/RecordingEngine.qml

find:
          running: engine.recording && engine.recOnDisk
          onTriggered: engine.recCapturedSec += 1

replace:
          running: engine.recording
          onTriggered: engine.recCapturedSec += 1

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_recordingengine.qml::test_the_counter_says_connecting_until_the_file_exists.
  Line-neutral.
